      "side": 1,
      "message": "What is the order of BthfConnectionState::SlcConnected and when this WbsCallback is called?\nI assume (a) SlcConnected happens before (b) WbsCallback(where codec negotiation happened).\n\nThat said, we need to block notifying CRAS until (b) to finalize `wbs_supported` value. Otherwise CRAS could immediately decide to start call in narrow-band.",
      "revId": "2fe78da3508b7b0abb548771db15099ebee206cd",
      "serverId": "85c56323-6fa9-3386-8a01-6480fb634889"
    },
