      "side": 1,
      "message": "Answered on previous comment. The order should be:\n1. WbsCallback triggered by AT+BAC\n2. SLC connected\n3. StartSco\n4. WbsCallback triggered by BCS\n\nI\u0027ll propose to trigger another event from the topshim to CRAS to reflect the change if the BCS doesn\u0027t align with the information we get from AT+BAC.",
